      "instructions": [
        "Print the template at 100% actual size and tape the pages together using the grid.",
        "Trace the Face Plate, Jaw Flap and Antenna once each onto cardboard.",
        "Keep each corrugation arrow lined up with the little waves inside the cardboard — that keeps the mask stiff and the folds crisp."
      ],
      "check": "You should have 3 pencil outlines, with the eye holes, slots and dashed lines marked inside them.",
      "tip": "Mark the holes by poking a pencil through the template at each corner, then connect the dots."
